/*!
 * @example c-and-cpp-callers.cxx
 *
 * @par [en] Consuming the library from C: five callbacks in, a handle out, then plain `foc_*` calls. [zh] 从 C 侧使用本库：五个回调进去、一个句柄出来，之后都是普通的 `foc_*` 调用。
 * @section callers_shows [en] What the example shows [zh] 这个例子展示了什么
 * @par [en] The whole integration sequence -- `foc_motor_create_host`, `foc_motor_enable`, `foc_set_torque`,
 *      `foc_tick`, `foc_get_state`, `foc_motor_get_status`, `foc_motor_destroy` -- with a host that owns the power
 *      stage. Nothing in it is C++: the callbacks are plain function pointers, and a pure C consumer writes the same
 *      lines.
 * @par [zh] 完整的集成序列——`foc_motor_create_host`、`foc_motor_enable`、`foc_set_torque`、`foc_tick`、
 *      `foc_get_state`、`foc_motor_get_status`、`foc_motor_destroy`——宿主自己拥有功率级。其中没有一处是 C++：
 *      回调就是普通函数指针，纯 C 消费者写的是同样的几行。
 *
 * @section callers_notimpl [en] The one callback whose absence has its own answer [zh] 唯一一个"缺失时单独回答"的回调
 * @par [en] `read_drive_fault` is the required callback that is **appended** to the struct, so it arrives as NULL from
 *      a caller built against an older header. That caller is not at fault, and "we never asked" must not read like
 *      "nothing is wrong" -- so `create_host()` answers `FOC_ERR_NOT_IMPL`, not `FOC_ERR_PARAM`. This example sets it,
 *      and the comment says why leaving it out is a refusal rather than a default.
 * @par [zh] `read_drive_fault` 是那个**追加**在结构体末尾的必需回调，所以按旧头编译的调用方会以 NULL 传进来。那不是
 *      它的错，而"我们没问"不能读成"什么都没坏"——所以 `create_host()` 答 `FOC_ERR_NOT_IMPL` 而不是
 *      `FOC_ERR_PARAM`。例子把它设上，并写明为什么漏掉它是一次拒绝而不是一个默认值。
 *
 * @section callers_stand_in [en] The host below is a stand-in, and it says so [zh] 下面的宿主是替身，而且它自己说了
 * @par [en] Ohm's law across the winding plus the winding's own `L/R`: enough for the current loop to regulate, and
 *      nothing more. A real host would be feeding ADC samples, and the page points at where that is shown instead.
 * @par [zh] 绕组上的欧姆定律加上绕组自身的 `L/R`：够让电流环调住，仅此而已。真实宿主喂的是 ADC 采样，页面会指出
 *      那件事在哪里演示。
 *
 * @section c_and_cpp_callers_numbers [en] The numbers behind the figure [zh] 图背后的数字
 * @par [en] The rows below are read out of this example's own `--csv` run -- the same run the figure is drawn from, so the table and the picture cannot disagree.
 *
 * \image html ALL_callers.png "Drawn from the same run the table below lists" width=760px
 *
 * | t (ms) | iq cmd (A) | iq measured (A) | duty span |
 * |---|---|---|---|
 * | 0.05 | 1.5000 | 0.0000 | 0.1277 |
 * | 10.05 | 1.5000 | 1.5000 | 0.0541 |
 * | 40.05 | -1.5000 | -1.5000 | 0.0541 |
 *
 * @par [zh] 下面这些行取自本示例自己的 `--csv` 输出——与图同一次运行，所以表和图不会互相矛盾。
 *
 * \image html ALL_callers.png "由下表所列的同一次运行绘制" width=760px
 *
 * | t (ms) | iq 给定 (A) | iq 实测 (A) | 占空比跨度 |
 * |---|---|---|---|
 * | 0.05 | 1.5000 | 0.0000 | 0.1277 |
 * | 10.05 | 1.5000 | 1.5000 | 0.0541 |
 * | 40.05 | -1.5000 | -1.5000 | 0.0541 |
 *
 * @section callers_same [en] One implementation, two doors, and the number that shows it
 *      [zh] 一份实现、两个门，以及证明它的那个数
 * @par [en] The program runs the same 60 ms experiment twice: once through the C handle
 *      (`foc_motor_create_host` -> `foc_set_torque` -> `foc_tick` -> `foc_get_state`), once through
 *      the C++ class (`foc::motor::Motor<...>::tick`), against two copies of the same stand-in plant
 *      with the same callbacks and the same nameplate. It then subtracts the two duty-span traces
 *      tick by tick. Measured on this build: **worst difference 0.000e+00 over 1200 ticks** -- the
 *      two doors reach the same object, so a C team and a C++ team on one product are running the
 *      same loop, and a Python user goes through `foc_python`, which sits on the C door.
 * @par [zh] 程序把同一个 60 ms 实验跑两遍：一遍走 C 句柄（`foc_motor_create_host` ->
 *      `foc_set_torque` -> `foc_tick` -> `foc_get_state`），一遍走 C++ 类
 *      （`foc::motor::Motor<...>::tick`），各自对着同一套替身台架的一份拷贝，回调相同、铭牌
 *      相同。然后把两条占空比跨度轨迹逐拍相减。本机构建上实测：**1200 拍内最大差
 *      0.000e+00**——两个门到的是同一个对象，所以同一个产品里的 C 组与 C++ 组跑的是同一条环，
 *      而 Python 用户经 `foc_python` 走的正是 C 这道门。
 *
 * @par [en] What differs is only what the door owns: the C handle owns a pool slot, so it must be
 *      destroyed; the C++ object owns its policies as members, so its lifetime is the scope. The
 *      loop, the refusals and the numbers are one implementation.
 * @par [zh] 不同的只是门所拥有的东西：C 句柄拥有一个池槽，所以必须销毁；C++ 对象把策略作为成员
 *      持有，生命周期就是作用域。环路、拒绝与数字都是同一份实现。
 *
 * @include c-and-cpp-callers.cxx
 *
 * @note [en] Link the aggregate target `foc::foc`; the command on the first line links every translation unit in the
 *            repository, including the one C file the ABI lives in.
 * @note [zh] 链接聚合目标 `foc::foc`；第一行的命令链了仓库里每一个翻译单元，包括 ABI 所在的那个 C 文件。
 *
 * @since 0.1.0
 */
